<title>USA: TABLE-Comstock Resources Q2 oper decreases.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Comstock Resources Q2 oper decreases.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter Ended  Six Months Ended</p>
<p>						  June 30,    June 30,</p>
<p>					 1997	1996    1997    1996</p>
<p> Total revenues		   18,279   17,890  42,007  27,518</p>
<p> Exploration expense		  --	285	--     285</p>
<p>Income from continuing</p>
<p>  operations			 4,134    6,891  12,057   9,446</p>
